<section class="sg-sec"><h2>People, places and events</h2><div class="tih-tags"><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Ferenc Kölcsey</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Ferenc Erkel</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Károly Kisfaludy</span><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/matyas-rakosi">Mátyás Rákosi</a><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Gyula Illyés</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Zoltán Kodály</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Mária V. Majzik</span><a class="tih-tag tih-tag-profile" href="/empire/hungary">Hungary</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/budapest">Budapest</a><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Budakeszi</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Habsburg censorship</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Austria-Hungary</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Third Hungarian Republic</span></div></section>
